+### D-002: Use ISO dates everywhere
+status: locked
+date: 2026-09-09
+owner: hamza
+author: agent
+model: claude-opus-5[1m]
+links: []
+supersedes: none
+
+All dates in the project are written as ISO `YYYY-MM-DD`, in the ledgers and
+elsewhere. One unambiguous format removes the locale ambiguity of forms like
+03/04/2026, and it sorts lexicographically. The alternative, letting each
+surface keep its own convention, was rejected as the source of that ambiguity.
